      "id": "t21_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -304
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Trails: state + spread\n\nThe Write* / Read* pair stash a SPREAD between frames. Read* emits last frame's spread; we append today's mouse vec2 to it (Stack), then Write* keeps the new spread for tomorrow.\n\nDraw the buffer as a Path → the line trails the cursor.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 240
      },
      "portValues": {
